      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“On the first day of the first month you shall erect the tabernacle of the tent of meeting. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall put in it the ark of the testimony, and you shall screen the ark with the veil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall bring in the table, and set its arrangements in order; and you shall bring in the lampstand, and set up its lamps. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall put the golden altar for incense before the ark of the testimony, and set up the screen for the door of the tabernacle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall set the altar of burnt offering before the door of the tabernacle of the tent of meeting, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and place the laver between the tent of meeting and the altar, and put water in it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you shall set up the court round about, and hang up the screen for the gate of the court. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you shall take the anointing oil, and anoint the tabernacle and all that is in it, and consecrate it and all its furniture; and it shall become holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall also anoint the altar of burnt offering and all its utensils, and consecrate the altar; and the altar shall be most holy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall also anoint the laver and its base, and consecrate it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you shall bring Aaron and his sons to the door of the tent of meeting, and shall wash them with water, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and put upon Aaron the holy garments, and you shall anoint him and consecrate him, that he may serve me as priest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall bring his sons also and put coats on them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and anoint them, as you anointed their father, that they may serve me as priests: and their anointing shall admit them to a perpetual priesthood throughout their generations.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
