          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus did Moses; according to all that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded him, so he did. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in the first month in the second year, on the first day of the month, the tabernacle was erected. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses erected the tabernacle; he laid its bases, and set up its frames, and put in its poles, and raised up its pillars; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he spread the tent over the tabernacle, and put the covering of the tent over it, as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he took the testimony and put it into the ark, and put the poles on the ark, and set the mercy seat above on the ark; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he brought the ark into the tabernacle, and set up the veil of the screen, and screened the ark of the testimony; as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he put the table in the tent of meeting, on the north side of the tabernacle, outside the veil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
