          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he put the golden altar in the tent of meeting before the veil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and burnt fragrant incense upon it; as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had commanded Moses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he put in place the screen for the door of the tabernacle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he set the altar of burnt offering at the door of the tabernacle of the tent of meeting, and offered upon it the burnt offering and the cereal offering; as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
